      <metadata>
        <description><![CDATA[{\pard Right-Click Toolbox\par
Gives REAPER a Cubase-style toolbox. Right-click, or press a shortcut to open a toolbar at the mouse, and pick a tool such as Draw, Eraser, Split, Glue, Mute or Zoom. Your left mouse button then works like that tool until you pick another.\par
After installing, run Right-Click Toolbox - Install (run once) from the action list. It adds every tool for the main window and the MIDI editor. Your own mouse settings are saved first; Object Selection puts them all back.\par
}]]></description>
        <link rel="website">https://github.com/KallumS/Reaper-Right-Click-Toolbar</link>
